  "id": "terminal-assessment",
  "term": "terminal assessment",
  "definition": "Terminal assessment is the final evaluation carried out at the end of a study or observation period. In this context, it refers to end-point measurement of outcomes such as pathology, spatial learning, and brain glucose metabolism.",
